{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\Books\\6th\\Math\\JPG\\113.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "6.2Algebra", "conf": 0.793, "box": [[823, 15], [1073, 0], [1077, 47], [827, 66]]}, {"text": "Maths History", "conf": 0.852, "box": [[1177, 64], [1397, 70], [1396, 110], [1176, 104]]}, {"text": "along with numbers which help us to solve many", "conf": 0.906, "box": [[236, 387], [1010, 377], [1011, 432], [237, 442]]}, {"text": "year 825 AD by the Muslim", "conf": 0.905, "box": [[1152, 393], [1537, 397], [1536, 444], [1152, 440]]}, {"text": "al-Khwarizmi (780-850 AD). He is", "conf": 0.912, "box": [[1157, 489], [1611, 505], [1610, 554], [1155, 538]]}, {"text": "represent a quantity by the symbol (A, ) or letter (a, b,", "conf": 0.921, "box": [[236, 521], [1108, 502], [1109, 565], [237, 583]]}, {"text": "known as the \"Father of Algebra\".", "conf": 0.889, "box": [[1159, 542], [1615, 558], [1614, 603], [1157, 588]]}, {"text": "C, x, y, z, etc.) without knowing its numerical value.", "conf": 0.927, "box": [[238, 592], [1036, 578], [1037, 630], [239, 644]]}, {"text": "As we know that numerals 1,3.. etc. and the basic operations (+, -, ×, + ) are used in", "conf": 0.933, "box": [[236, 648], [1613, 644], [1613, 705], [237, 710]]}, {"text": "operations (+, -, ×, - ).", "conf": 0.824, "box": [[248, 770], [619, 775], [618, 814], [247, 809]]}, {"text": "Let's consider the following example.", "conf": 0.917, "box": [[245, 841], [876, 847], [876, 890], [244, 883]]}, {"text": "The price of a bookmark is Rs 50. If Rohma wants to buy 12 bookmarks, how much will", "conf": 0.912, "box": [[248, 919], [1618, 924], [1618, 967], [248, 962]]}, {"text": "she pay?", "conf": 0.851, "box": [[247, 985], [396, 988], [395, 1033], [246, 1030]]}, {"text": "Previous Knowledge Check", "conf": 0.88, "box": [[1257, 1005], [1645, 1012], [1644, 1048], [1257, 1041]]}, {"text": "To find the price of 12 bookmarks, we need to know the rule.", "conf": 0.899, "box": [[248, 1051], [1218, 1059], [1218, 1102], [247, 1093]]}, {"text": ".If one quantity is given", "conf": 0.889, "box": [[1275, 1069], [1599, 1081], [1598, 1118], [1274, 1106]]}, {"text": "The table shows that.", "conf": 0.858, "box": [[250, 1117], [602, 1125], [601, 1160], [249, 1153]]}, {"text": "how can we find the price", "conf": 0.862, "box": [[1314, 1116], [1629, 1122], [1628, 1154], [1314, 1149]]}, {"text": "of multiple quantities?", "conf": 0.881, "box": [[1318, 1161], [1597, 1161], [1597, 1194], [1318, 1194]]}, {"text": "The price of 1 bookmark is Rs 50 = 50 × 1", "conf": 0.878, "box": [[251, 1177], [922, 1185], [922, 1224], [250, 1216]]}, {"text": "Ifpriceofmultiplenumber", "conf": 0.885, "box": [[1306, 1205], [1641, 1205], [1641, 1235], [1306, 1235]]}, {"text": "The price of 2 bookmarks is Rs 100 = 50 × 2", "conf": 0.895, "box": [[253, 1245], [958, 1250], [958, 1290], [252, 1284]]}, {"text": "of itemsaregivenhowcan", "conf": 0.919, "box": [[1320, 1246], [1645, 1246], [1645, 1279], [1320, 1279]]}, {"text": "we find the price of one", "conf": 0.881, "box": [[1322, 1289], [1620, 1286], [1620, 1319], [1322, 1321]]}, {"text": "The price of 5 bookmarks is Rs 250 = 50 × 5", "conf": 0.899, "box": [[254, 1311], [958, 1318], [958, 1357], [253, 1351]]}, {"text": "item?", "conf": 0.762, "box": [[1319, 1327], [1398, 1327], [1398, 1363], [1319, 1363]]}, {"text": "The price of 8 bookmarks is Rs 400 = 50 × 8", "conf": 0.89, "box": [[254, 1379], [960, 1385], [960, 1424], [253, 1418]]}, {"text": "Hence, the rule of the pattern is multiply the number of bookmarks by 50.", "conf": 0.907, "box": [[254, 1444], [1433, 1462], [1432, 1504], [253, 1485]]}, {"text": "So, the price of 12 bookmarks is = Rs 50 × 12 = Rs 600", "conf": 0.916, "box": [[256, 1508], [1130, 1521], [1129, 1566], [255, 1554]]}, {"text": "Rs 50 × x.", "conf": 0.834, "box": [[260, 1646], [426, 1648], [426, 1686], [259, 1683]]}, {"text": "Here, the number of bookmarks is a changing quantity.", "conf": 0.932, "box": [[467, 1728], [1339, 1762], [1337, 1812], [465, 1778]]}, {"text": "Yes. We use x to denote the changing", "conf": 0.897, "box": [[741, 1877], [1328, 1911], [1326, 1950], [739, 1916]]}, {"text": "quantity, so x is a variable here.", "conf": 0.925, "box": [[744, 1935], [1228, 1958], [1227, 1998], [742, 1975]]}, {"text": "NOTFORISALE", "conf": 0.858, "box": [[383, 2057], [674, 2057], [674, 2093], [383, 2093]]}, {"text": "111", "conf": 0.748, "box": [[968, 2076], [1033, 2076], [1033, 2116], [968, 2116]]}]}